@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "用户" as User
participant "voimed" as Daemon
participant "StatusNotifierWatcher" as Watcher
participant "托盘宿主\nWaybar / Vicinae" as Host
participant "voime TUI\n可选" as Tui

Daemon -> Watcher : RegisterStatusNotifierItem
Watcher -> Host : 新 item 可用
Host -> Daemon : 读取 IconPixmap / ToolTip / Menu
Host -> Host : 显示托盘图标

User -> Host : 右键点击图标
Host -> Daemon : DBusMenu.GetLayout
Daemon --> Host : 菜单项：退出
Host -> Host : 显示“退出”

User -> Host : 点击“退出”
Host -> Daemon : DBusMenu.Event(1, clicked)
Daemon -> Daemon : TrayEvent::Quit
Daemon -> Tui : Bye / socket close
Daemon -> Daemon : 停止采集、关闭 grab/VK/IM、删除 socket

note right of Daemon
  托盘由 voimed 持有，与 TUI 无关。
  没有 StatusNotifier 宿主时：
  不显示图标，daemon 继续运行，
  voime ctl quit 仍然可用。
end note
@enduml
